{"node_id": "NRS_484B_517", "law_refs": ["NRS-484B-517"], "subject": {"binder": "subject", "class_elements": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"]}, "segmentation": [{"id": "s1", "text": "A person shall not stop, stand or park a vehicle", "role": "obligation"}, {"id": "s2", "text": "other than a bus", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s3", "text": "in a bus stop,", "role": "condition"}, {"id": "s4", "text": "or a taxicab", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s5", "text": "in a taxicab stand,", "role": "condition"}, {"id": "s6", "text": "when such stop or stand has been officially designated and appropriately signed,", "role": "condition"}, {"id": "s7", "text": "except that the driver of a passenger vehicle", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s8", "text": "may temporarily stop there", "role": "standard"}, {"id": "s9", "text": "and for the purpose of and while actually engaged in", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s10", "text": "expeditiously", "role": "standard"}, {"id": "s11", "text": "loading or unloading of passengers", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s12", "text": "when such stopping does not interfere with", "role": "standard"}, {"id": "s13", "text": "any bus or taxicab", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s14", "text": "waiting to enter or about to enter such zone.", "role": "exception"}], "elements": [{"span": "s1", "atoms": ["dev.governs", "dev.human_direction", "dev.railway_signal_or_gate", "dev.stop_sign", "dev.traffic_signal", "dev.yield_sign", "rel.ahead_behind_in_lane", "rel.occupies", "rel.surface_gap", "ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle", "st.travel_region"], "derived": ["drv.motion.complete_halt"], "justification": "'Stop' when prohibited is 'any halting, even momentarily, of a vehicle, whether occupied or not, except when necessary to avoid conflict with other traffic or in compliance with the directions of a police officer or official traffic-control device' (DEF-NRS-484A-260, the definition the table resolves for 'stopping' in this law); 'stand' is 'the halting of a vehicle, whether occupied or not' (DEF-NRS-484A-250) and 'park' 'the standing of a vehicle' (DEF-NRS-484A-155): together a halt, drv.motion.complete_halt ('at rest at the observation ... its speed at or below a tolerance', p.halt_speed_tolerance). The definition's exclusions are carried beside it: a halt with another road user ahead in the same lane (rel.ahead_behind_in_lane) within p.queue_halt_gap of the body (rel.surface_gap, 'distance between the nearest points of two bodies', not a centre distance) avoids conflict with other traffic; a halt on a travel region the subject occupies (rel.occupies, st.travel_region) governed (dev.governs) by a stop sign, a yield sign, a traffic signal showing red or yellow, a railway signal flashing or a gate not up, or a police officer's stop indication (dev.stop_sign, dev.yield_sign, dev.traffic_signal, dev.railway_signal_or_gate, dev.human_direction) complies with a device or an officer. 'Vehicle' is the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle."}, {"span": "s2", "atoms": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-030::bus"], "derived": [], "justification": "'Bus' is the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-030::bus ('a vehicle owned by the State, a political subdivision or a private school or nursery, designed for carrying ... passengers and used for the transportation of persons, or a vehicle, other than a taxicab, designed and used for the transportation of persons for compensation'), claimed as one atom, never expanded."}, {"span": "s3", "atoms": ["rel.occupies", "st.curb_zone"], "derived": [], "justification": "A bus stop at the curb is st.curb_zone of kind bus_stop ('a signed or marked length of curb'), which the subject's footprint overlaps (rel.occupies, 'a road user's footprint overlaps a lane / region (... curb zone ...)')."}, {"span": "s4", "atoms": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-270::taxicab"], "derived": [], "justification": "'Taxicab' is the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-270::taxicab ('a motor vehicle designed or constructed to accommodate and transport ... passengers, including the driver, and used to transport passengers for a charge or fee'), claimed as one atom."}, {"span": "s5", "atoms": ["rel.occupies", "st.curb_zone"], "derived": [], "justification": "'Taxicab stand' is 'a fixed area in a highway parallel and adjacent to the curb or edge of the highway and set aside for taxicabs to stand for passengers' (DEF-NRS-484B-067): st.curb_zone of kind taxicab_stand ('a signed or marked length of curb'), which the subject's footprint overlaps (rel.occupies)."}, {"span": "s6", "atoms": ["rel.occupies", "st.curb_zone"], "derived": [], "justification": "That the stop or stand 'has been officially designated and appropriately signed' is its legal status, read from the feature's presence on the road: the curb zone of kind bus_stop or taxicab_stand the subject occupies (st.curb_zone, 'a signed or marked length of curb'; rel.occupies) is presumed designated and signed."}, {"span": "s7", "atoms": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle", "ru.truck", "ru.trailer_or_combination"], "derived": [], "justification": "'Driver' is 'every person who drives or is in actual physical control of a vehicle' (DEF-NRS-484A-080), read through the vehicle's controlled motion. 'Passenger vehicle' has no posted definition: it is read as a vehicle (the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle) not built to carry goods or to be drawn: not ru.truck ('motor vehicle for carrying goods, with a body built for that purpose') and not ru.trailer_or_combination ('vehicle drawn by another, or the combination'), carried beside the aggregate."}, {"span": "s9", "atoms": [], "derived": ["drv.motion.complete_halt"], "justification": "'While actually engaged in' fixes the loading to the stop itself: the door of s11 is open at an observation of the same halt (drv.motion.complete_halt, 'at rest at the observation'); the purpose is read by that conduct."}, {"span": "s11", "atoms": ["sig.door_open"], "derived": [], "justification": "