ver of a passenger vehicle' is read on the vehicle's controlled motion.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "agency"}, {"span": "s4", "why": "The purpose of a halt is read through the class, occupancy and time conditions of the zone's posted sign holding for the vehicle; a restriction to a purpose the sign's legend states as none of these is not read, and a halt outside the sign's posted hours is read as not for the restricted purpose.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "purpose"}, {"span": "s5", "why": "'Passenger vehicle', which no posted definition defines, is read as a vehicle that is neither a truck nor a trailer or combination.", "kind": "reading"}, {"span": "s8", "why": "The purpose of and engagement in loading or unloading passengers are read by a door of the halted vehicle open during the halt.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "purpose"}, {"span": "s10", "why": "'Waiting to enter or about to enter' is read by a vehicle halted outside the zone within the waiting reach; one still moving toward the zone is not read as waiting.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "intention"}, {"span": "s11", "why": "The waiting vehicle's purpose of parking in accordance with the restriction is read by the posted sign's conditions holding for it.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "purpose"}], "scenarios": [{"name": "forbid", "expected": "violated", "narrative": "A passenger car halts in a restricted_parking curb zone, governed by a parking_restricted zone sign whose class condition the car does not meet, for longer than the standing duration, doors closed."}, {"name": "permit", "expected": "compliant", "narrative": "A vehicle meeting the sign's class condition, at a time inside its posted hours, parks in the zone."}, {"name": "idle", "expected": "not_applicable", "narrative": "A passenger car halts at a curb where there is no restricted_parking curb zone."}, {"name": "blind", "expected": "unknown", "narrative": "A passenger car not 