o accommodate and transport ... passengers, including the driver, and used to transport passengers for a charge or fee'), claimed as one atom."}, {"span": "s5", "atoms": ["rel.occupies", "st.curb_zone"], "derived": [], "justification": "'Taxicab stand' is 'a fixed area in a highway parallel and adjacent to the curb or edge of the highway and set aside for taxicabs to stand for passengers' (DEF-NRS-484B-067): st.curb_zone of kind taxicab_stand ('a signed or marked length of curb'), which the subject's footprint overlaps (rel.occupies)."}, {"span": "s6", "atoms": ["rel.occupies", "st.curb_zone"], "derived": [], "justification": "That the stop or stand 'has been officially designated and appropriately signed' is its legal status, read from the feature's presence on the road: the curb zone of kind bus_stop or taxicab_stand the subject occupies (st.curb_zone, 'a signed or marked length of curb'; rel.occupies) is presumed designated and signed."}, {"span": "s7", "atoms": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle", "ru.truck", "ru.trailer_or_combination"], "derived": [], "justification": "'Driver' is 'every person who drives or is in actual physical control of a vehicle' (DEF-NRS-484A-080), read through the vehicle's controlled motion. 'Passenger vehicle' has no posted definition: it is read as a vehicle (the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle) not built to carry goods or to be drawn: not ru.truck ('motor vehicle for carrying goods, with a body built for that purpose') and not ru.trailer_or_combination ('vehicle drawn by another, or the combination'), carried beside the aggregate."}, {"span": "s9", "atoms": [], "derived": ["drv.motion.complete_halt"], "justification": "'While actually engaged in' fixes the loading to the stop itself: the door of s11 is open at an observation of the same halt (drv.motion.complete_halt, 'at rest at the observation'); the purpose is read by that conduct."}, {"span": "s11", "atoms": ["sig.door_open"], "derived": [], "justification": "