{"node_id": "NRS_484B_510", "law_refs": ["NRS-484B-510"], "subject": {"binder": "subject", "class_elements": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"]}, "segmentation": [{"id": "s1", "text": "A person shall not stop, stand or park a vehicle", "role": "obligation"}, {"id": "s2", "text": "for any purpose or length of time", "role": "condition"}, {"id": "s3", "text": "in any restricted parking zone", "role": "condition"}, {"id": "s4", "text": "other than for the purpose to which parking in such zone is restricted,", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s5", "text": "except that a driver of a passenger vehicle", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s6", "text": "may stop temporarily", "role": "standard"}, {"id": "s7", "text": "in such zone", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s8", "text": "for the purpose of and while actually engaged in loading or unloading of passengers", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s9", "text": "when such stopping does not interfere with", "role": "standard"}, {"id": "s10", "text": "any vehicle which is waiting to enter or about to enter the zone", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s11", "text": "for the purpose of parking in accordance with the purpose to which parking is restricted.", "role": "exception"}], "elements": [{"span": "s1", "atoms": ["dev.governs", "dev.human_direction", "dev.railway_signal_or_gate", "dev.stop_sign", "dev.traffic_signal", "dev.yield_sign", "rel.ahead_behind_in_lane", "rel.occupies", "rel.surface_gap", "ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle", "st.travel_region"], "derived": ["drv.motion.complete_halt"], "justification": "'Stop' when prohibited is 'any halting, even momentarily, of a vehicle, whether occupied or not, except when necessary to avoid conflict with other traffic or in compliance with the directions of a police officer or official traffic-control device' (DEF-NRS-484A-260, the definition the table resolves for 'stopping' in this law); 'stand' is 'the halting of a vehicle, whether occupied or not' (DEF-NRS-484A-250) and 'park' 'the standing of a vehicle' (DEF-NRS-484A-155): together a halt, drv.motion.complete_halt ('at rest at the observation ... its speed at or below a tolerance', p.halt_speed_tolerance). The definition's exclusions are carried beside it: a halt with another road user ahead in the same lane (rel.ahead_behind_in_lane) within p.queue_halt_gap of the body (rel.surface_gap, 'distance between the nearest points of two bodies', not a centre distance) avoids conflict with other traffic; a halt on a travel region the subject occupies (rel.occupies, st.travel_region) governed (dev.governs) by a stop sign, a yield sign, a traffic signal showing red or yellow, a railway signal flashing or a gate not up, or a police officer's stop indication (dev.stop_sign, dev.yield_sign, dev.traffic_signal, dev.railway_signal_or_gate, dev.human_direction) complies with a device or an officer. 'Vehicle' is the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle."}, {"span": "s3", "atoms": ["rel.occupies", "st.curb_zone"], "derived": [], "justification": "A restricted parking zone is st.curb_zone of kind restricted_parking ('a signed or marked length of curb'), which the subject's footprint overlaps (rel.occupies, 'a road user's footprint overlaps a lane / region (... curb zone ...)')."}, {"span": "s4", "atoms": ["dev.zone_sign", "dev.governs", "prim.conditions_hold", "rel.occupies", "st.travel_region"], "derived": [], "justification": "The purpose to which parking is restricted is the restriction the zone's posting states: a zone sign of kind parking_restricted (dev.zone_sign, whose 'conditions attribute' carries 'a vehicle class' and time windows) governing (dev.governs) a travel region (st.travel_region) the subject occupies (rel.occupies). A halt is for that purpose where the sign's conditions hold for the subject (prim.conditions_hold: 'any occupancy or class condition is met'); the sign is not read as the condition holding (dev.zone_sign is 'not a stand-in for whether the condition holds now')."}, {"span": "s5", "atoms": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle", "ru.truck", "ru.trailer_or_combination"], "derived": [], "justification": "'Driver' is 'every person who drives or is in actual physical control of a vehicle' (DEF-NRS-484A-080), read through the vehicle's controlled motion. 'Passenger vehicle' has no posted definition: it is read as a vehicle (the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle) not built to carry goods or to be drawn: not ru.truck ('motor vehicle for carrying goods, with a body built for that purpose') and not ru.trailer_or_combination ('vehicle drawn by another, or the combination'). The class atoms are carried beside the aggregate, never in place of it."}, {"span": "s7", "atoms": ["rel.occupies", "st.curb_zone"], "derived": [], "justification": "'In such zone': the same restricted_parking curb zone (st.curb_zone) the subject's footprint overlaps (rel.occupies), re-bound with the selection of s3."}, {"span": "s8", "atoms": ["sig.door_open"], "derived": ["drv.motion.complete_halt"], "justification": "The purpose of and engagement 'in loading or unloading of passengers' are read by the conduct: a door of the halted vehicle (drv.motion.complete_halt) open (sig.door_open, 'a door open') during the halt."}, {"span": "s10", "atoms": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle", "rel.occupies", "st.curb_zone", "st.region_geometry"], "derived": ["drv.motion.complete_halt"], "justification": "'Any vehicle' is the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle; 'waiting to enter or about to enter the zone' is read by the conduct: that vehicle does not overlap the zone (rel.occupies, st.curb_zone of s3) and is halted (drv.motion.complete_halt) with the ground distance from its body to the zone (st.region_geometry, 'the ground distance from a road user's body outline to it') within p.zone_entry_wait_reach."}, {"span": "s11", "atoms": ["prim.conditions_hold", "dev.zone_sign", "dev.governs", "st.travel_region"], "derived": [], "justification": "Parking 'in accordance with the purpose to which parking is restricted' is read, for the waiting vehicle, as the conditions of the parking_restricted zone sign (dev.zone_sign) governing (dev.governs) a travel region (st.travel_region) the subject occupies holding for that vehicle (prim.conditions_hold, 'any occupancy or class condition is met')."}], "operationalizations": [{"span": "s6", "standard": "temporarily", "concepts": ["drv.motion.parked"], "params": ["p.standing_min_duration", "p.halt_speed_tolerance"], "convention": "curbside passenger pick-up dwell: a stop counts as temporary while it has not lasted as long as a passenger pick-up dwell, i.e. while the subject is not at rest at every observation of a window of length p.standing_min_duration behind the observation (drv.motion.parked)", "surrogate": false}, {"span": "s9", "standard": "does not interfere with", "concepts": ["drv.motion.complete_halt", "st.region_geometry", "rel.occupies"], "params": ["p.zone_entry_wait_reach", "p.halt_speed_tolerance"], "convention": "queueing at a curb space: a stop interferes with a vehicle where, at some observation of the stop so far, that vehicle stands halted outside the zone within one passenger-car length plus a queue spacing of it (p.zone_entry_wait_reach), the place a vehicle waits to take the space", "surrogate": false}], "assumptions": [], "intentions": [], "compositions": [], "residues": [{"span": "s2", "why": "'For any purpose or length of time' excludes no halt: every halt is within the prohibition whatever its purpose and length, so the duty is the same whether or not these words are read.", "scope": "none"}], "binders": [{"name": "subject", "class_elements": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"]}], "applicability": "The subject is a vehicle (ru.aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle) whose footprint overlaps (rel.occupies) a curb zone z of kind restricted_parking (st.curb_zone).", "obligation": "Wherever the subject occupies such a zone z (selected again as in the applicability), the subject is not halted (drv.motion.complete_halt with p.halt_speed_tolerance), except a halt that is (a) to avoid conflict with other traffic: some other road user is ahead of the subject in the same lane (rel.ahead_behind_in_lane) with a gap between bodies (rel.surface_gap) at most p.queue_halt_gap; or (b) in compliance with a device or an officer: a travel region the subject occupies is governed (dev.governs) by a stop sign, a yield sign, a traffic signal displaying a red or yellow indication or flashing_red, a railway signal or gate with lights flashing or gate not up, or a person in the role police_officer giving the indication stop; or (c) for the purpose to which parking is restricted: some zone sign of kind parking_restricted (dev.zone_sign) governing (dev.governs) a travel region the subject occupies has its conditions holding for the subject (prim.conditions_hold); or (d) a temporary stop of a passenger vehicle for passengers: the subject is neither a truck (ru.truck) nor a trailer or combination (ru.trailer_or_combination), it is not parked with min_duration p.standing_min_duration (drv.motion.parked), a door of the subject is open (sig.door_open) at some observation of the same halt, before or after the observation, and at no observation of the halt up to the judged one is there a vehicle other than the subject (ru.aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle) whose footprint does not overlap z, which is halted (drv.motion.complete_halt), whose body's ground distance to z (st.region_geometry) is at most p.zone_entry_wait_reach, and for which the conditions of such a parking_restricted zone sign hold (prim.conditions_hold).", "params": ["p.halt_speed_tolerance", "p.queue_halt_gap", "p.standing_min_duration", "p.zone_entry_wait_reach"], "narrowings": [{"span": "s1", "why": "'A person shall not stop, stand or park a vehicle' is read on the vehicle's controlled motion.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "agency"}, {"span": "s5", "why": "'A driver of a passenger vehicle' is read on the vehicle's controlled motion.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "agency"}, {"span": "s4", "why": "The purpose of a halt is read through the class, occupancy and time conditions of the zone's posted sign holding for the vehicle; a restriction to a purpose the sign's legend states as none of these is not read, and a halt outside the sign's posted hours is read as not for the restricted purpose.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "purpose"}, {"span": "s5", "why": "'Passenger vehicle', which no posted definition defines, is read as a vehicle that is neither a truck nor a trailer or combination.", "kind": "reading"}, {"span": "s8", "why": "The purpose of and engagement in loading or unloading passengers are read by a door of the halted vehicle open during the halt.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "purpose"}, {"span": "s10", "why": "'Waiting to enter or about to enter' is read by a vehicle halted outside the zone within the waiting reach; one still moving toward the zone is not read as waiting.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "intention"}, {"span": "s11", "why": "The waiting vehicle's purpose of parking in accordance with the restriction is read by the posted sign's conditions holding for it.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "purpose"}], "scenarios": [{"name": "forbid", "expected": "violated", "narrative": "A passenger car halts in a restricted_parking curb zone, governed by a parking_restricted zone sign whose class condition the car does not meet, for longer than the standing duration, doors closed."}, {"name": "permit", "expected": "compliant", "narrative": "A vehicle meeting the sign's class condition, at a time inside its posted hours, parks in the zone."}, {"name": "idle", "expected": "not_applicable", "narrative": "A passenger car halts at a curb where there is no restricted_parking curb zone."}, {"name": "blind", "expected": "unknown", "narrative": "A passenger car not 