 accordance with the purpose to which parking is restricted' is read, for the waiting vehicle, as the conditions of the parking_restricted zone sign (dev.zone_sign) governing (dev.governs) a travel region (st.travel_region) the subject occupies holding for that vehicle (prim.conditions_hold, 'any occupancy or class condition is met')."}], "operationalizations": [{"span": "s6", "standard": "temporarily", "concepts": ["drv.motion.parked"], "params": ["p.standing_min_duration", "p.halt_speed_tolerance"], "convention": "curbside passenger pick-up dwell: a stop counts as temporary while it has not lasted as long as a passenger pick-up dwell, i.e. while the subject is not at rest at every observation of a window of length p.standing_min_duration behind the observation (drv.motion.parked)", "surrogate": false}, {"span": "s9", "standard": "does not interfere with", "concepts": ["drv.motion.complete_halt", "st.region_geometry", "rel.occupies"], "params": ["p.zone_entry_wait_reach", "p.halt_speed_tolerance"], "convention": "queueing at a curb space: a stop interferes with a vehicle where, at some observation of the stop so far, that vehicle stands halted outside the zone within one passenger-car length plus a queue spacing of it (p.zone_entry_wait_reach), the place a vehicle waits to take the space", "surrogate": false}], "assumptions": [], "intentions": [], "compositions": [], "residues": [{"span": "s2", "why": "'For any purpose or length of time' excludes no halt: every halt is within the prohibition whatever its purpose and length, so the duty is the same whether or not these words are read.", "scope": "none"}], "binders": [{"name": "subject", "class_elements": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"]}], "applicability": "The subject is a vehicle (ru.aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle) whose footprint overlaps (rel.occupies) a curb zone z of kind restricted_parking (st.curb_zone).", "obligation": "Wherever the subject occupies such a zone z (selected again as in the applicability), the subject is not halted (drv.motion.complete_halt with p.halt_speed_tolerance), except a halt that is (a) to avoid conflict with other traffic: some other road user is ahead of the subject in the same lane (rel.ahead_behind_in_lane) with a gap between bodies (rel.surface_gap) at most p.queue_halt_gap; or (b) in compliance with a device or an officer: a travel region the subject occupies is governed (dev.governs) by a stop sign, a yield sign, a traffic signal displaying a red or yellow indication or flashing_red, a railway signal or gate with lights flashing or gate not up, or a person in the role police_officer giving the indication stop; or (c) for the purpose to which parking is restricted: some zone sign of kind parking_restricted (dev.zone_sign) governing (dev.governs) a travel region the subject occupies has its conditions holding for the subject (prim.conditions_hold); or (d) a temporary stop of a passenger vehicle for passengers: the subject is neither a truck (ru.truck) nor a trailer or combination (ru.trailer_or_combination), it is not parked with min_duration p.standing_min_duration (drv.motion.parked), a door of the subject is open (sig.door_open) at some observation of the same halt, before or after the observation, and at no observation of the halt up to the judged one is there a vehicle other than the subject (ru.aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle) whose footprint does not overlap z, which is halted (drv.motion.complete_halt), whose body's ground distance to z (st.region_geometry) is at most p.zone_entry_wait_reach, and for which the conditions of such a parking_restricted zone sign hold (prim.conditions_hold).", "params": ["p.halt_speed_tolerance", "p.queue_halt_gap", "p.standing_min_duration", "p.zone_entry_wait_reach"], "narrowings": [{"span": "s1", "why": "'A person shall not stop, stand or park a vehicle' is read on the vehicle's controlled motion.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "agency"}, {"span": "s5", "why": "'A driver of a passenger vehicle' is read on the vehicle's controlled motion.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "agency"}, {"span": "s4", "why": "The purpose of a halt is read through the class, occupancy and time conditions of the zone's posted sign holding for the vehicle; a restriction to a purpose the sign's legend states as none of these is not read, and a halt outside the sign's posted hours is read as not for the restricted purpose.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "purpose"}, {"span": "s8", "why": "The purpose of and engagement in loading or unloading passengers are read by a door of the halted vehicle open during the halt.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "purpose"}, {"span": "s10", "why": "'Waiting to enter or about to enter' is read by a vehicle halted outside the zone within the waiting reach; one still moving toward the zone is not read as waiting.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "intention"}, {"span": "s11", "why": "The waiting vehicle's purpose of parking in accordance with the restriction is read by the posted sign's conditions holding for it.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "purpose"}], "scenarios": [{"name": "forbid", "expected": "violated", "narrative": "A passenger car halts in a restricted_parking curb zone, governed by a parking_restricted zone sign whose class condition the car does not meet, for longer than the standing duration, doors closed."}, {"name": "permit", "expected": "compliant", "narrative": "A vehicle meeting the sign's class condition, at a time inside its posted hours, parks in the zone."}, {"name": "idle", "expected": "not_applicable", "narrative": "A passenger car halts at a curb where there is no restricted_parking curb zone."}, {"name": "blind", "expected": "unknown", "narrative": "A passenger car not meeting the sign's conditions halts briefly in the zone, shorter than the standing duration; the source does not observe its doors.", "masked": ["sig.door_open"]}, {"name": "bra